# Test-only deploy manifests. DeployProtocolScriptTest and the crates/e2e
# ChainFixture write deployments/31337[67]*.json (test-only chain ids in the
# 3133769xxxx..3133775xxxx band); a failed/interrupted run can leave one on disk
# before cleanup runs. Real-chain manifests use other ids and can still be
# committed with `git add -f`.
deployments/31337[67]*.json

# Local Anvil dev manifest written by dev-deploy.sh (chain id 31337).
